video game "Lionheart: Legacy of the Crusader".

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Black Isle Studios,
Reflexive Entertainment, Interplay Entertainment, GOG, or any current or former
rights holder in the game. All trademarks are the property of their respective
owners.

The MIT license in LICENSE covers this project's own work: the tools, the file
format implementations, and the documentation. It does not and cannot grant any
rights in "Lionheart: Legacy of the Crusader" itself.

This repository contains no content from the game. The file formats documented
here were determined by reverse engineering for the purpose of interoperability.
The tools operate on a copy of the game that the user already owns; they neither
include nor redistribute any part of it.
